<ol><li>Open <strong>More</strong>.</li><li>Go to <strong>My account → Privacy and data</strong>.</li><li>Tap <strong>Delete my account and data</strong>.</li><li>Confirm permanent deletion.</li></ol><p>The flow removes the Firebase Authentication account; profile and summary in Cloud Firestore; workspace links, team, invitations, synchronized ERP records, plan status and counters in Cloudflare D1; and local business data stored by the app. A recent sign-in may be required.</p></section><section><h2>Outside the application</h2><p>Write from the account email to <a href="mailto:e-mail@rumman.app.br?subject=Rumman%20account%20deletion">e-mail@rumman.app.br</a> with the subject <strong>Rumman account deletion</strong>. Identity may be verified. The stated deadline is up to 15 days after verification.</p><p>A web request removes remote records but cannot reach data physically stored on an offline device. Clear the app data in Android or uninstall Rumman to remove it.</p></section><section><h2>Subscription and retention</h2><p>If a Google Play subscription is offered in the future, it must also be canceled in <strong>Google Play → Payments and subscriptions</strong>. Deleting the account does not replace cancellation of store-managed billing.</p><p>Records strictly required by law, security or fraud prevention may be retained for the applicable period with restricted access.</p></section></div></article></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="wrap footer-main"><div class="footer-brand-block"><a class="brand footer-brand" href="/en/"><span class="brand-icon"><img src="/assets/icon-192.png" width="192" height="192" alt=""></span><span class="brand-name">Rumman</span></a><p>Guided intelligent Android ERP for small businesses.</p><a class="footer-contact" href="mailto:e-mail@rumman.app.br">Contact Rumman: e-mail@rumman.app.br</a><nav class="language-switcher footer-language" aria-label="Language"><span class="visually-hidden">Language</span><a href="/excluir-conta" la